WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.950
Instalment plans: customers' instalments: due dates, reminders and overdue payments.

2
00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:11.080
Review plans by the next due date.

3
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:18.130
For a manual reminder, click "Remind next"; send the "Customer page" link to the customer.

4
00:00:18.678 --> 00:00:25.750
Default instalment count, interval and "Grace before overdue (days)" are in "Payment settings".

5
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:32.330
Waiving an instalment ("Waive next") can't be undone; be sure first.
